WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.970
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:18.240 --> 00:20.940
[Sung Inho]

3
00:25.810 --> 00:27.480
[Kim Domin]

4
00:43.770 --> 00:50.100
[Summertime]

5
00:59.430 --> 01:00.780
It's so delicious.

6
01:01.020 --> 01:02.270
Thank you.

7
01:04.470 --> 01:05.379
Hello.

8
01:05.650 --> 01:06.350
Welcome.

9
01:06.420 --> 01:07.020
Hello.

10
01:07.180 --> 01:08.390
Two servings of pork belly,

11
01:08.390 --> 01:10.620
one soybean paste stew, and one bottle of soju, right?

12
01:10.620 --> 01:12.080
Yes, I will leave it to you.

13
01:12.200 --> 01:13.020
Thank you.

14
01:13.150 --> 01:14.390
Just give me a moment.

15
01:17.230 --> 01:18.890
Drop the honorifics.

16
01:19.180 --> 01:22.780
You don't have to turn your head to drink. Just drink it like that.

17
01:27.980 --> 01:31.330
[New Message] [To: Yeo Eunho: Eunho, I...]

18
01:39.370 --> 01:40.490
Here's the alcohol.

19
01:40.490 --> 01:41.360
Thank you.

20
01:41.479 --> 01:42.460
Enjoy your meal.

21
01:44.530 --> 01:45.680
Do you need a receipt?

22
01:45.680 --> 01:46.280
It's okay.

23
01:46.430 --> 01:47.020
Okay.

24
01:47.170 --> 01:48.200
Thank you.

25
01:48.490 --> 01:49.420
Take some candy.

26
01:49.500 --> 01:50.310
Thank you.

27
01:50.530 --> 01:51.710
Take care.

28
02:04.700 --> 02:07.960
[Yeo Eunho]

29
02:40.040 --> 02:41.150
[Cha Dohyun: good at studying, student council president, handsome, can get into a good school, can find a good job]

30
02:41.150 --> 02:42.290
[Me: bad at studying, a proud member of the school, handsome and cute, can work at my parents, live with Cha Dohyun]

31
02:42.290 --> 02:44.070
[Childhood friends? Old friends? Lovers?] [All of the above]

32
02:48.050 --> 02:50.370
You are the only one I like.

33
02:51.640 --> 02:53.650
You like a lot of things,

34
02:54.420 --> 02:56.050
and you are very capable.

35
02:57.810 --> 02:59.320
Whether it's back in school or now,

36
02:59.320 --> 03:00.220
when I'm with you,

37
03:00.220 --> 03:01.660
I'm always the worse off one.

38
03:01.660 --> 03:03.930
Just find someone as good as you.

39
03:14.800 --> 03:15.890
Thank you for the meal, sir.

40
03:15.890 --> 03:17.990
Thank you. Take care.

41
03:18.110 --> 03:19.850
-Take care. -Thank you.

42
03:23.110 --> 03:26.150
Gosh, sir, can we close now?

43
03:26.470 --> 03:27.890
Okay, let's close.

44
03:28.150 --> 03:29.000
Eunho,

45
03:29.160 --> 03:30.900
let us know whenever you've made up your mind.

46
03:30.900 --> 03:32.900
This barbecue restaurant is yours.

47
03:32.960 --> 03:33.910
Okay.

48
03:34.250 --> 03:35.600
By the way, Eunho,

49
03:35.720 --> 03:38.050
a part-timer is coming tomorrow.

50
03:38.950 --> 03:39.980
A part-timer?

51
03:40.420 --> 03:41.530
Who is it?

52
03:46.160 --> 03:47.820
Hello.

53
03:48.700 --> 03:50.150
Please take care of me.

54
03:50.730 --> 03:52.829
My back has been hurting lately.

55
03:52.990 --> 03:55.490
My knees hurt too.

56
03:56.400 --> 03:58.360
He'll only work for a month.

57
03:58.930 --> 04:00.190
A month?

58
04:01.820 --> 04:03.020
I'll leave him to you.

59
04:09.820 --> 04:11.060
Yes, Professor.

60
04:12.810 --> 04:14.820
I have something to do today,

61
04:14.960 --> 04:17.019
so I can't attend the dinner.

62
04:17.930 --> 04:19.200
I'm sorry.

63
04:24.960 --> 04:25.830
Just go.

64
04:26.020 --> 04:27.810
That dinner must be very important to you.

65
04:27.810 --> 04:29.760
I'll handle my own business.

66
04:30.300 --> 04:32.210
I'm here to work part-time.

67
04:39.000 --> 04:40.470
Put on the apron.

68
04:47.640 --> 04:50.290
After the customer orders, enter the table number first.

69
04:50.290 --> 04:51.909
There are 5 side dishes.

70
04:52.080 --> 04:53.740
The cabbage salad will wilt if mixed in advance,

71
04:53.740 --> 04:55.860
so it must be mixed right before serving.

72
04:55.860 --> 04:58.100
When cutting meat, cut against the grain so it's tender.

73
04:58.100 --> 04:59.250
You should serve the alcohol to the table

74
04:59.250 --> 05:00.880
instead of letting the customers get it themselves.

75
05:00.880 --> 05:02.160
When changing the grill pan, to prevent oil splatters,

76
05:02.160 --> 05:04.000
don't forget to cover it with the new pan before taking it out.

77
05:04.000 --> 05:04.940
Right—

78
05:05.650 --> 05:07.600
clean the table immediately after the customer leaves.

79
05:07.600 --> 05:10.670
Make sure it's clean before seating the next customer.

80
05:12.600 --> 05:13.800
Understood?

81
05:37.670 --> 05:39.790
This cabbage salad looks stale.

82
05:46.520 --> 05:49.420
Toss it gently so it won't wilt.

83
06:05.220 --> 06:07.240
You got my clothes dirty.

84
06:10.800 --> 06:12.260
I'm sorry.

85
06:33.570 --> 06:35.940
What are you staring at? Get back to work.

86
06:37.130 --> 06:38.200
Oh.

87
06:53.150 --> 06:54.810
Today is your last day, right?

88
06:55.430 --> 06:56.870
Good job this past month.

89
06:57.180 --> 06:59.110
Your salary has been transferred.

90
07:08.150 --> 07:10.080
Yeo Eunho, I have something to say.

91
07:17.010 --> 07:19.720
Is there anything left to say between us?

92
07:23.770 --> 07:25.050
I'm off.

93
07:42.040 --> 07:44.090
Whether in the past or now,

94
07:44.920 --> 07:47.120
you're still so selfish.

95
07:51.100 --> 07:54.190
Let's break up, Yeo Eunho.

96
07:59.580 --> 08:02.740
Cha Dohyun. Cha Dohyun!

97
08:03.240 --> 08:04.190
Cha Dohyun!

98
08:37.690 --> 08:39.640
You called out to Dohyun so anxiously,

99
08:39.640 --> 08:41.630
as if you were breaking up.

100
08:43.860 --> 08:45.760
I don't know. I had a nightmare.

101
08:46.770 --> 08:49.370
Have you taught him everything about the shop?

102
08:50.680 --> 08:52.720
He won't be coming anymore anyway.

103
08:58.610 --> 09:00.070
According to solar terms,

104
09:00.210 --> 09:02.500
we've officially crossed the threshold into summer.

105
09:02.500 --> 09:04.580
It'll be mostly sunny across the country today,

106
09:04.580 --> 09:06.000
with daytime temperatures soaring

107
09:06.000 --> 09:06.790
and bringing blistering heat everywhere.

108
09:06.790 --> 09:08.520
By the way, did Dohyun tell you?

109
09:08.580 --> 09:09.800
As temperatures rise sharply...

110
09:09.800 --> 09:12.800
He said he's going to Vietnam next week to help with Jihyun's business.

111
09:12.800 --> 09:14.000
there will be

112
09:14.750 --> 09:16.260
no major rainfall expected for the foreseeable future.

113
09:16.260 --> 09:17.570
Fair and dry conditions will persist.

114
09:17.570 --> 09:20.030
It seems he's going to stay and not come back.

115
09:21.700 --> 09:22.760
He's going to stay?

116
09:22.770 --> 09:23.710
Yeah.

117
09:24.410 --> 09:26.840
Jihyun's business is growing.

118
09:26.980 --> 09:29.780
After all, it's good for the family to be together.

119
09:32.500 --> 09:34.430
Yeo Eunho, I have something to say.

120
09:49.240 --> 09:53.810
[Cha Dohyun]

121
09:59.860 --> 10:02.320
Yeo Eunho, come out.

122
10:03.690 --> 10:07.190
I'm dying of heat. Come out immediately.

123
10:10.540 --> 10:13.360
Where are you going? Aren't you eating?

124
11:10.920 --> 11:12.260
Yeo Eunho.

125
11:13.740 --> 11:15.550
I'm doomed.

126
11:18.710 --> 11:21.260
I thought a lot when you weren't around.

127
11:22.870 --> 11:24.320
The conclusion is no.

128
11:31.660 --> 11:33.120
I thought a hundred times—

129
11:34.400 --> 11:36.860
no, a thousand times—

130
11:37.050 --> 11:38.950
I can't live without you.

131
11:43.850 --> 11:45.980
That thing you said about breaking up,

132
11:46.420 --> 11:47.830
take it back.

133
11:49.100 --> 11:50.980
I'll pretend I never heard it.

134
11:56.280 --> 11:58.750
I never thought you weren't good enough for me.

135
11:58.750 --> 12:00.940
Nor did I think I was out of your league.

136
12:03.200 --> 12:05.630
Because you are the standard,

137
12:05.880 --> 12:08.480
there is no other standard to measure against.

138
12:09.370 --> 12:10.510
So,

139
12:11.550 --> 12:13.510
just be yourself.

140
12:17.360 --> 12:19.270
No matter what you look like

141
12:19.760 --> 12:21.300
or what you do,

142
12:23.920 --> 12:26.110
let me be the one to like you.

143
12:46.770 --> 12:48.950
Don't ever say things like that again.

144
12:51.210 --> 12:52.660
Never.

145
13:38.360 --> 13:40.220
Mom, I'm taking the day off today.

146
13:41.290 --> 13:42.140
Hey!

147
13:42.310 --> 13:44.620
Where are you going instead of working?

148
13:44.880 --> 13:47.970
Hey, Eunho, we have a group of customers today!

149
13:58.170 --> 13:59.750
Oh my god, he's exactly my type.

150
13:59.750 --> 14:00.490
Where?

151
14:00.750 --> 14:02.480
Hey, don't stare so obviously.

152
14:02.860 --> 14:04.830
The guy sitting over there.

153
14:07.280 --> 14:08.700
Could he be a sports major?

154
14:08.700 --> 14:11.140
Why would a sports major sit in front of the business administration building?

155
14:11.140 --> 14:14.010
They have to take some general education courses too, you know.

156
14:14.010 --> 14:17.010
But whether it's his looks or his body, he's really...

157
14:17.080 --> 14:18.250
Handsome, right?

158
14:19.400 --> 14:21.930
If you look closely, he's even more handsome.

159
14:22.010 --> 14:25.010
Eyes, nose, mouth.

160
14:26.160 --> 14:29.340
He looks really handsome when he just wakes up.

161
14:29.600 --> 14:31.500
It's a pity that you won't get to see

162
14:31.500 --> 14:33.050
his real face.

163
14:33.490 --> 14:36.120
Did you know he's also secretly muscular?

164
14:39.030 --> 14:40.390
Yeo Eunho.

165
14:51.960 --> 14:52.890
What's going on?

166
14:53.070 --> 14:54.420
What did you say to them?

167
14:56.080 --> 14:57.670
Something.

168
14:59.050 --> 15:00.110
Let's go.

169
15:00.480 --> 15:03.130
Hmm? Where are we going?

170
15:03.500 --> 15:05.100
You'll see when we get there.

171
15:19.600 --> 15:20.600
Where are we going?

172
15:20.600 --> 15:21.420
Over there.

173
15:23.330 --> 15:25.910
Look, a lunchbox made by Yeo Eunho himself.

174
15:32.990 --> 15:34.260
What are you doing?

175
15:35.210 --> 15:36.790
Because I like you.

176
15:40.460 --> 15:42.360
Let's eat. I'm hungry.

177
15:45.930 --> 15:46.900
Say "ah."

178
15:54.830 --> 15:55.550
Is it good?

179
15:55.680 --> 15:58.530
Yeah, it's good.

180
16:00.410 --> 16:01.730
You have some too.

181
16:07.900 --> 16:09.050
Have another one.

182
16:14.050 --> 16:14.720
I'm done.

183
16:14.800 --> 16:15.840
Just one last bite.

184
16:15.840 --> 16:16.760
No.

185
16:17.970 --> 16:18.780
Is it good?

186
16:18.950 --> 16:20.570
Hey, you have some too.

187
16:22.440 --> 16:23.610
Eat up.

188
16:26.240 --> 16:27.410
Have another one.

189
16:28.500 --> 16:29.990
Say "ah"—

190
16:30.360 --> 16:31.370
"ah."

191
17:02.290 --> 17:03.370
Cha Dohyun.

192
17:08.700 --> 17:10.440
Fulfill a wish of mine.

193
17:11.869 --> 17:12.980
What is it?

194
17:13.940 --> 17:16.380
Whatever I say next,

195
17:17.130 --> 17:19.190
don't laugh and just repeat after me.

196
17:23.069 --> 17:24.260
I love you.

197
17:32.390 --> 17:33.530
I love you more.

198
18:23.260 --> 18:24.300
What's going on?

199
18:26.480 --> 18:27.760
What do you mean?

200
18:27.890 --> 18:29.310
It's break time now.

201
18:35.490 --> 18:38.210
But why are you wearing a school uniform?

202
18:40.070 --> 18:43.530
Students should wear school uniforms. What else would I wear?

203
18:47.690 --> 18:49.230
Are you still half asleep?

204
19:00.170 --> 19:01.330
So it was a dream.

205
19:11.670 --> 19:12.690
Cha Dohyun.

206
19:13.670 --> 19:15.730
What are you going to do after school?

207
19:17.610 --> 19:19.270
What do you want to do?

208
19:22.500 --> 19:24.900
Wanna go to an internet cafe and play games?

209
19:26.090 --> 19:27.190
Sure.

210
19:28.970 --> 19:30.190
Actually, no.

211
19:31.120 --> 19:33.580
Let's just go home and have instant noodles.

212
19:34.470 --> 19:35.880
Sounds good.

213
19:45.930 --> 19:47.690
You're acting weird today.

214
19:50.900 --> 19:54.340
Cha Dohyun, what's the date today?

215
19:55.890 --> 19:56.920
What?

216
19:57.940 --> 20:00.040
Your birthday is coming up, right?

217
20:29.720 --> 20:31.070
What are you doing?

218
20:31.820 --> 20:35.350
Don't move. I'm going to give you a gift.

219
20:42.240 --> 20:43.920
Here. That's your gift.

220
20:49.390 --> 20:50.740
What is this?

221
20:52.550 --> 20:53.800
Proof.

222
20:54.620 --> 20:55.710
What?

223
20:56.880 --> 20:58.940
Proof that you're mine.

224
21:04.290 --> 21:06.530
I don't know yet,

225
21:07.020 --> 21:10.470
but you'll probably make me stressed a lot in the future.

226
21:11.810 --> 21:13.750
So I had to do something

227
21:14.150 --> 21:16.440
so I wouldn't feel so wronged.

228
21:19.160 --> 21:21.740
You're the one who's still half asleep,

229
21:22.520 --> 21:24.780
so why do I feel like I'm the one dreaming?

230
21:33.480 --> 21:34.810
That's the school bell.

231
21:34.870 --> 21:37.370
Go back to your class, Cha Dohyun.

232
21:38.540 --> 21:40.070
Where are you going?

233
21:41.830 --> 21:42.980
I'm...

234
21:44.440 --> 21:46.300
also going to find where I belong.

235
21:53.740 --> 21:56.000
You're not going somewhere else, right?

236
22:09.260 --> 22:11.200
Cha Dohyun, don't worry.

237
22:12.940 --> 22:15.490
My final destination can only be by your side.

238
22:25.740 --> 22:27.340
Come and catch me.

239
22:28.630 --> 22:30.530
I will always wait for you.

240
22:34.460 --> 22:36.240
In this never-ending

241
22:37.360 --> 22:39.520
summer of ours.

242
22:41.520 --> 22:47.700
[Thank you all for your support for "Summertime"]

243
22:48.320 --> 22:54.500
[Summertime]
